  "source": "TO-3 table1.1 sheets4/5; section3.2 sheets30/31; sections4.19/4.20 sheets104/105; section4.25 sheet108",
  "boundaries": [
    "Logical SPOP-to-IZOP interval derived from section3.2 start/end and equal table minimum/maximum.",
    "AND/OR:4 cycles; packing/unpacking:53 cycles. Variable operations have no inferred average.",
    "Initial/early RPK, buffer allocation, electrical D2 timing and full UU sequencing remain incomplete.",
    "One CPU and common instruction handlers; Dubna A/Y/R behavior preserved.",
    "Functional CERN/golden validate compatibility, not a complete hardware OS gate."
  ]
